1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,478
I fill job forms all day, but nobody ever replies.

2
00:00:03,778 --> 00:00:09,050
Bunty, fill those forms for other people! Open a xerox and online forms shop!

3
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:11,230
A xerox machine? Those cost lakhs!

4
00:00:11,530 --> 00:00:17,688
A refurbished machine, a printer, a laptop and a laminator. All for ₹1.5 lakh.

5
00:00:17,988 --> 00:00:23,343
Get a shop near a college, a court or a government office. Everyone there needs copies.

6
00:00:23,893 --> 00:00:28,359
Son, ten copies of my Aadhaar, and fill in this pension form online.

7
00:00:28,659 --> 00:00:32,726
₹2 a copy, and ₹100 to fill in the form, uncle.

8
00:00:33,026 --> 00:00:40,843
A copy costs 50 paise to make. Copies, prints and forms add up to over ₹1,500 a day.

9
00:00:41,143 --> 00:00:46,892
Add passport photos, lamination and stationery. In exam season there'll be a queue.

10
00:00:47,192 --> 00:00:50,026
Bunty Xerox, every form done right here! Life set!
